# 67. Final Conceptual Model

The infrastructure must be understood as a series of layers:

```text
1. OBJECT
2. OBJECT IDENTITY
3. CONTENT INTEGRITY
4. STORAGE CLASS
5. STORAGE POLICY
6. LOCAL STORAGE
7. METADATA
